      "content": "i mean i'm a bit busy with work rn and dont really wanna spend hours in a clinic just for a skin thing. do u think i could just try some over the counter antifungal cream like clotrimazole and see if it goes down in a day or two? if it's just a minor infection it should clear up pretty quick right?",
